sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Dep as Deploy system
    participant Ct as Canary controller
    participant LB as Load balancer
    participant Can as Canary pods
    participant Base as Baseline pods
    participant Mx as Metrics
    Dep->>Ct: new revision
    Ct->>Can: roll out a small slice
    Ct->>LB: send a fraction of traffic to canary
    loop each analysis interval
        Ct->>Mx: canary vs baseline for the same window
        Mx-->>Ct: latency, errors, saturation
        Ct->>Ct: score against the adjusted threshold
    end
    alt score holds
        Ct->>LB: step traffic up
        Ct->>Base: replace with the new revision
    else score drops
        Ct->>LB: pull canary out of rotation
        Ct->>Can: roll back
        Note over Ct: error budget burn tightens the threshold for the next deploy
    end
